      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19168/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix brown and white sugar with the milk in large pot; bring mixture to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8iDLzizIMKM5uti6JVHPWX8cqDA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19168-grandpas-peanut-butter-fudge-VAT-4x3-step-02-a758c26ac5cd4f60bab43da94bf317ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19168/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in peanut butter, reduce heat to medium, and bring the mixture back to boil (stirring constantly)",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NRWM9qK2f3I1XJYdIWBRuLrBej4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19168-grandpas-peanut-butter-fudge-VAT-4x3-step-03-325b98ef93f64412829d95a6b5a2bf17.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19168/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the pot from heat when a drop of the mixture forms a ball in a glass of cold water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Hl2n8ztLpreCJ6SKPfuTB6XdKR0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19168-grandpas-peanut-butter-fudge-VAT-4x3-step-04-a8ee0e31ed494112bdff59099a50e63d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19168/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir margarine and vanilla into the mixture; stir vigorously until the fudge hardens. (Always stir in same direction.)",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oOSr-dCQo5L0eF1nQguJU8eBhhQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19168-grandpas-peanut-butter-fudge-VAT-4x3-step-05-1782648b2c1a48aea5c3bdc78777131d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19168/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour fudge onto buttered plates or waxed paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
